EXT. FERRIS WHEEL, TOP GONDOLA - NIGHT

A county-fair Ferris wheel, lit gold against a black sky. It has stopped. The top gondola sways. Far below, a crowd and a stuttering generator.

PETRA SOLBERG-IWU (30s, vintage dress, nerves) clutches the safety bar. Beside her, CALLUM "CAL" ARDOUIN (30s, bad blazer, worse haircut) leans over the rail and waves at the ground.

CAL
(shouting)
Hello down there! We're fine!

PETRA
They can't hear you.

CAL
They'll see me waving.

PETRA
They'll see a man falling.

He pulls back, sits, grips the bar beside her. The gondola creaks.

CAL
Okay. So. This is not how I planned it.

PETRA
How did you plan it?

CAL
Cotton candy. Slow ride. Kiss at the top.

PETRA
We are at the top.

CAL
Yes.

PETRA
Cal.

CAL
Yes?

PETRA
It's not a good moment.

CAL
It's an excellent moment. We have all the time in the world. We're stuck.

She laughs, sharp. Looks away.

PETRA
(to herself)
Oh, this is ridiculous.

CAL
What did you say?

PETRA
Nothing.

CAL
You said ridiculous.

PETRA
I said it to myself.

A gust. The gondola lurches. She seizes his arm. He freezes. They both look at her hand.

CAL
(softly)
Petra.

PETRA
I'm not letting go.

CAL
I wouldn't ask you to.

Below, a loudspeaker crackles.

OPERATOR (V.O.)
(distant, bullhorn)
Folks, we're working on it! Stay seated! Do not stand!

Cal cups his hands and calls down.

CAL
(shouting)
Take your time!

PETRA
(shouting)
No, hurry up!

CAL
(shouting)
Take your time!

PETRA
(shouting)
Hurry up!

They look at each other. And laugh. The laughter fades into a silence that feels different.

CAL
I'm going to kiss you now.

PETRA
Don't you dare.

CAL
Why not?

PETRA
Because if you do, and they start the wheel, I'll miss it.

CAL
You'll miss the kiss?

PETRA
I'll miss the view. You'll be in front of it.

He grins. Sits back. Both of them stare out over the gold-lit fair and the dark fields beyond it.

CAL
It's pretty up here.

PETRA
It is.

The wheel shudders. Moves.

CAL
Ah. There it goes.

PETRA
Cal.

CAL
Yes?

PETRA
Now.

He turns. She meets him halfway. The gondola begins its slow descent, and the generator coughs, and they ride down in a pool of golden light.
